          "col_start": 1,
          "words": "Explore ways to make LLMs more stable and robust in the face of descriptive tasks.\nInvestigate whether LLMs can learn to explore purposefully and how to better utilize causal knowledge in tasks. Analyze\nthe performance of LLMs in different tasks and contexts to see if they can adapt like humans. Explore how LLMs\ndevelop and refine their cognitive abilities during natural interactions with humans."
