          "row_start": 8,
          "col_start": 1,
          "words": "Developing new therapeutic techniques and evidence-based practices (EBPs). Focus on evidence-based practices first:\nto create meaningful clinical impact in the short term, clinical LLM applications based on existing evidence-based\npsychotherapies and techniques will have the greatest chance of success. Involve interdisciplinary collaboration.\nFocuses on therapist and patient trust and usability. Criteria for designing effective clinical LLMs."
